OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in hospital after being
OL,4,Ahit by car                             
OL,6,FA woman has died after she was hit by a
OL,7,Fcar in Jersey, police have said.       
OL,9,FJocelyne Vibert, 78, died in hospital  
OL,10,Fafter being struck by a grey Hyundai   
OL,11,FTucson on La Grande Route de St Ouen at
OL,12,Fabout 12:15 GMT on Saturday, States of 
OL,13,FJersey Police said.                    
OL,15,FThe crash happened at the junction with
OL,16,FRoute du Marais near the parish hall,  
OL,17,Fsaid the force.                        
OL,19,FPolice said her family was being       
OL,20,Fsupported by specialist family liaison 
OL,21,Fofficers while an investigation into   
OL,22,Fthe crash remained ongoing.            
